summary:
  The engine's clock adds whatever the wall clock says has passed between two beats.

history:
  A laptop that sleeps eight hours wakes with a beat eight hours late,
  and a clock set back by NTP gives one that is negative. The writer cut
  nothing in either. A beat longer than three seconds, or one that runs
  backwards, counts as one second.

target:
  package/contents/ui/SlideLogic.js

find:
      return (gone >= 0 && gone <= TICK_SANE_MS) ? gone : TICK_MS;

replace:
      return gone;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_slidelogic.qml::test_a_beat_adds_what_passed_unless_the_clock_jumped.
